{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41881","headline":"赠谦明上人 · 李中","name":"赠谦明上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虽寄上都眠竹寺，逸情终忆白云端。\n闲登锺阜林泉晚，梦去沃洲风雨寒。\n新试茶经煎有兴，旧婴诗病舍终难。\n常闻秋夕多无寐，月在高台独凭栏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}